{"voice":"kokoro af_heart","speed":0.92,"pages":{"0":{"title":"Averi's Brave First Step","text":"","src":"p0.mp3","dur":2.3,"t":[]},"1":{"text":"“What if I forget?” Averi asked, imagining the big school stage. Her dance was only three days away, and her tummy felt full of butterflies.","src":"p1.mp3","dur":9.85,"t":[[0,0.44],[0.44,0.56],[0.56,0.66],[0.66,1.02],[1.88,1.93],[1.88,2.32],[2.74,3.22],[3.22,3.46],[3.46,3.6],[3.6,3.82],[3.82,4.26],[5.04,5.18],[5.18,5.42],[5.42,5.72],[5.72,6.02],[6.02,6.28],[6.28,6.54],[6.54,6.86],[6.86,7.38],[7.38,7.5],[7.5,7.82],[7.82,8.02],[8.02,8.34],[8.34,8.48],[8.48,9.02]]},"2":{"text":"Yuna was sitting under a tree with a notebook. “Stories have beginnings, middles, and endings,” she said. “Maybe your dance does too.”","src":"p2.mp3","dur":8.63,"t":[[0.36,0.58],[0.58,0.82],[0.82,1.06],[1.06,1.32],[1.32,1.46],[1.46,1.7],[1.7,1.96],[1.96,2.06],[2.06,2.32],[3.1,3.46],[3.46,3.78],[3.78,4.1],[4.66,4.8],[4.8,5.1],[5.1,5.42],[5.42,6.02],[6.02,6.28],[6.72,6.92],[6.92,7.16],[7.16,7.34],[7.34,7.64],[7.64,7.98]]},"3":{"text":"They drew three chalk stars on the sidewalk. Averi stood on the first and took a breath.","src":"p3.mp3","dur":5.67,"t":[[0,0.4],[0.4,0.56],[0.56,0.9],[0.9,1.14],[1.14,1.48],[1.48,1.88],[1.88,1.96],[1.96,2.24],[3.22,3.27],[3.22,3.58],[3.58,3.74],[3.74,3.84],[3.84,4.12],[4.12,4.48],[4.48,4.64],[4.64,4.74],[4.74,5]]},"4":{"text":"On the second star she practiced her trickiest turn. She wobbled the first time, then spun all the way around. On the third, she held her final pose.","src":"p4.mp3","dur":10.35,"t":[[0,0.42],[0.42,0.5],[0.5,0.8],[0.8,1.16],[1.16,1.42],[1.42,1.7],[1.7,2.02],[2.02,2.4],[2.4,2.74],[3.52,3.6],[3.6,3.98],[3.98,4.12],[4.12,4.34],[4.34,4.7],[5.06,5.22],[5.22,5.46],[5.46,5.92],[5.92,6.06],[6.06,6.18],[6.18,6.5],[7.4,7.52],[7.52,7.62],[7.62,7.92],[8.32,8.44],[8.44,8.62],[8.62,8.8],[8.8,9.18],[9.18,9.48]]},"5":{"text":"The next day the stage still looked big. But Averi remembered the three stars (beginning, middle, ending) and took her first step.","src":"p5.mp3","dur":8.43,"t":[[0,0.38],[0.38,0.52],[0.52,0.78],[0.78,0.92],[0.92,1.26],[1.26,1.56],[1.56,1.82],[1.82,2.16],[2.9,3],[3,3.2],[3.2,3.68],[3.68,3.9],[3.9,4.12],[4.12,4.46],[4.46,4.92],[5.74,5.79],[6.18,6.6],[6.78,6.86],[6.86,7],[7,7.18],[7.18,7.4],[7.4,7.78]]},"7":{"text":"What Averi learned She had not waited until she felt completely unafraid. She had danced while feeling nervous, and that was what made her brave.","src":"p7.mp3","dur":9.72,"t":[[0,0.46],[0.46,0.68],[0.68,1.24],[1.9,1.98],[1.98,2.06],[2.06,2.2],[2.2,2.5],[2.5,2.88],[2.88,3.06],[3.06,3.24],[3.24,3.78],[3.78,4.6],[5.34,5.54],[5.54,5.64],[5.64,5.88],[5.88,6.26],[6.26,6.54],[6.54,6.96],[6.96,7.6],[7.6,7.8],[7.8,8.08],[8.08,8.28],[8.28,8.48],[8.48,8.64],[8.64,8.96]]},"8":{"text":"3 big takeaways Word to know nervous Nervous is the jittery, worried feeling you can get before something big, like butterflies in your tummy. Practice the Tricky Part On three chalk stars, Averi practiced her dance. On the second star she tried her trickiest turn: she wobbled the first time, then kept going and spun all the way around. Brave Means Trying While Nervous Averi did not wait until she felt completely unafraid. The stage still looked big, but she danced while feeling nervous, and that is what made her brave. Try it at home: Pick one tricky move, like a spin or a hop on one foot, try it a few times, and notice how it gets steadier after the first wobble.","src":"p8.mp3","dur":46.53,"t":[[0,0.25],[0.5,0.76],[0.76,1.32],[2.08,2.14],[2.14,2.32],[2.32,2.5],[3.24,3.54],[4.28,4.62],[4.62,4.76],[4.76,4.92],[4.92,5.5],[5.56,5.86],[5.86,6.28],[6.28,6.5],[6.5,6.64],[6.64,6.86],[6.86,7.12],[7.12,7.46],[7.46,7.9],[8.14,8.28],[8.28,8.66],[8.66,9.22],[9.22,9.3],[9.3,9.68],[10.26,10.46],[10.46,10.88],[10.88,11.02],[11.02,11.42],[12.04,12.09],[12.08,12.3],[12.3,12.56],[12.56,12.96],[13.52,13.6],[13.6,14.12],[14.12,14.38],[14.38,14.62],[15.66,16.1],[16.1,16.2],[16.2,16.46],[16.4